00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:11.460
A man was stuck on the roof of his house because of a flood.

118
00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:12.460
So he prayed.

119
00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.460
God, please save me!

120
00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:18.460
Minutes later, a man in a boat came by.

121
00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:19.460
Hop in!

122
00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:20.460
I'll take you to safety!

123
00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:22.460
But the man said,

124
00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:23.460
"No thanks.

125
00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:25.460
God will save me."

126
00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:28.460
Then a rescue team in a motorboat showed up.

127
00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:29.460
"Get in!

128
00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:30.460
The water's rising!"

129
00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:31.460
Again, he said,

130
00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:32.460
"No!

131
00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:34.460
God will save me!"

132
00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:40.460
Then a helicopter threw him a rope, but he didn't grab it because he was still

133
00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:41.460
waiting

134
00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:43.460
for a miracle from God.

135
00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:44.460
"God!"

136
00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:47.460
The man, unfortunately, drowned.

137
00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:50.460
And when he got to heaven, he asked,

138
00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:54.460
"God, why didn't you save me?"

139
00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:55.460
And God said,

140
00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:59.460
"I sent you a rowboat, a motorboat, a helicopter.

141
00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:01.460
What more were you waiting for?"

142
00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:09.460
Sometimes we wait for miracles to happen and ignore the help that's already here.

143
00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:12.000
If you take a bamboo seed and water it, nothing happens.
